      "writtenOn": "2024-11-11T16:41:22Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This allows a virtio-gpu frontend to enable Features::GlAsyncSwap if it really wants to. This only has an effect if the VMM explicitly enables this with \"GlAsyncSwap:enabled\" (and also \"VirtioGpuNativeSync:disabled\").\n\nI understand asynchronous swapping isn\u0027t actually there without the proper host fencing support. However, synchronous swapping through virtio-gpu sync mechanisms is currently revealing some performance issues in Android guests (at least on QNX reference images). Using `GlAsyncSwap:enabled,VirtioGpuNativeSync:disabled`, on-screen benchmarks are matching their off-screen counterparts. So although there might be some incorrect output, and this isn\u0027t a production-ready configuration, it gives VMMs (i.e. QNX QVM) some additional tools for demonstration purposes (i.e. benchmarks).",
      "revId": "06f00644d20516fb7826d5257c70ba4b5d82695b",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": false,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "09a196a0_ea9ea13a",
        "filename": "/PATCHSET_LEVEL",
        "patchSetId": 1
      },
      "lineNbr": 0,
      "author": {
        "id": 3115162
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-11-11T16:44:38Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "To clarify, the reason we need \"sync_device_exists() \u003d\u003d true\" when trying to use asyncSwaps is in RenderControl: https://android.googlesource.com/platform/hardware/google/gfxstream/+/refs/heads/main/host/RenderControl.cpp#320\n\n```\nstatic bool shouldEnableAsyncSwap(const gfxstream::host::FeatureSet\u0026 features) {\n    bool isPhone \u003d true;\n    bool playStoreImage \u003d features.PlayStoreImage.enabled;\n    return features.GlAsyncSwap.enabled \u0026\u0026\n           emugl_sync_device_exists() \u0026\u0026 (isPhone || playStoreImage) \u0026\u0026\n           sizeof(void*) \u003d\u003d 8;\n}\n\n```",
      "parentUuid": "bdd72386_acab8112",
      "revId": "06f00644d20516fb7826d5257c70ba4b5d82695b",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
